              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BABSKITCHEN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I tried this on chicken and it was o.k. The alcohol flavor is very noticeable. I think I'd like to try it on flank steak the next time like the submitter suggested. It seemed to be missing a little something, maybe as simple as salt?",
